OL,3,AUK government expected to announce
OL,4,Arestrictions on trade with West Bank
OL,5,Asettlements
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government is to set out new
OL,8,Frestrictions on buying goods made in
OL,9,FJewish settlements in the
OL,10,FIsraeli-occupied West Bank, the BBC
OL,11,Funderstands.
OL,13,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband is
OL,14,Fexpected to outline the measures in the
OL,15,FCommons on Tuesday, which could include
OL,16,Frestrictions on trade in agricultural
OL,17,Fproducts from settlements.
OL,19,FLast week, Miliband said he would
OL,20,Funveil a "comprehensive reset" of the
OL,21,FBritish government's policy on Israel.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
